        model: 'First: are messages being rejected, and where do they end up? I ask IT for the interface’s error list over the last month: how many, which status codes and which reasons, such as closed orders. Then we see whether the cause is in the process or in the technology. And we appoint an owner who checks the error list daily, with an agreement on how fast errors get fixed.',
