          options: ['Nothing special, error queues fill up by themselves in every interface', 'Something is going wrong and nobody fixes it', 'The interface works extra well, because it neatly catches all errors', 'The interface server needs more memory'],
          answer: 'Something is going wrong and nobody fixes it',
