          options: ['Nothing: a minor version doesn’t break anything, so it can go straight in', 'Ask the supplier to rename the field back for your plant alone', 'Have the interface mapping adapted and tested in acceptance first', 'Install it and watch whether the ERP still gets its completion reports'],
          answer: 'Have the interface mapping adapted and tested in acceptance first',
          why: 'Under semver a minor version shouldn’t break anything, but the release notes say otherwise here, and they win. Waiting to see in production means completion reports that never reach the ERP.',
